<title>USA: Albertson's same-store sales up 0.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Albertson's same-store sales up 0.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albertson's Inc said comparable store sales rose 0.3 percent for the four-week period ended January 30, 1997 over the same four-week period last year.</p>
<p>Total sales increased 7.5 percent over the same four-week period last year.</p>
<p>For the thirteen-week period ended January 30, 1997, total sales rose 9.1 percent and comparable store sales increased 1.3 percent over the same thirteen-week period last year.</p>
</text>
